<header class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">GNK DINAMO LTD. GROUP · NEW YORK · 6–8 OCTOBER 2026</div><h1>THE CODE</h1><h2>NOT AN EVENT. NOT A PRESENTATION. NOT ONE ACQUISITION.</h2><p>A business architecture developed across decades is leaving secrecy and entering its public and operational phase. Multiple companies, markets, technologies and operating structures. One code. One activation.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn gold" href="/media-application/?lang=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener">1 · REGISTER NEWSROOM</a><a class="btn" href="/the-code/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">2 · OPEN THE CODE</a><a class="btn light" href="/api/media-registration/memorandum.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener">3 · OPEN PDF MEMORANDUM</a></div></div></header>
<main>
<section class="section white"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">Official media invitation</div><h2>One code. Multiple companies. A new global group.</h2><p class="lead">GNK DINAMO Ltd. Group presents THE CODE as a first-of-its-kind international media programme combining the presentation of a multi-company international acquisition, the unveiling of a new global group and the live activation of THE CODE.</p><div class="quote">WE ARE NOT FLYING INTO SPACE. WE ARE NOT CHASING THE STARS.<br><br>We are in your car. In your home. On your road. Here on Earth — with you.<br><br><strong>THE CODE ACTIVATES. THE WHOLE WORLD BECOMES OUR HOME.</strong></div><div class="grid"><div class="card"><strong>7 October 2026</strong><small>Central activation · 11:30 a.m. ET</small></div><div class="card"><strong>20 July 2026</strong><small>Application deadline · 23:59 CEST</small></div><div class="card"><strong>Up to 3</strong><small>Delegates per approved newsroom</small></div><div class="card"><strong>45</strong><small>Companies and related entities</small></div><div class="card"><strong>5</strong><small>Continents</small></div><div class="card"><strong>EUR 0.00</strong><small>Approved official media programme</small></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><div class="eyebrow">The international acquisition</div><h2>This is not the acquisition of a single company.</h2><p class="lead">THE CODE connects multiple international companies, sectors, markets, technology solutions, development capabilities, assets and operating systems. The identities of participating entities, transaction details, governance structure and sequence of integration remain restricted until the official disclosure.</p><div class="notice"><strong>Nermin Sefić</strong> is the Founder, Director and Ultimate Beneficial Owner of GNK DINAMO Ltd. Group. Subject to completion of the announced transactions, further ownership and governance details will be presented during the official New York programme.</div></div></section>
